  speakerName: Lito
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Look out! A horse carriage is passing through!

    When you need
    someone to pause and wait for you, you can say ''urayennak.''

    It means ''please
    wait'' or ''wait for me.''

    Listen carefully: urayennak.

    Now, try saying
    ''urayennak'' yourself.'
